{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:299","content":{"id":299,"title":"原则","content":[{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"30275f5d-d162-47bb-b61a-009d787fabde","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"00829b1e-5658-422f-87da-7f3f5d541098","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a34bac46-5938-49ce-bcf8-50cd470b9115","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设定边界"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7be27517-460b-4a6e-b9dc-8711ddff9ba3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人的精力有限，不可能成为全领域的专家，一定要设定自己需要精进的领域，把有限的精力投入其中，而之外的东西要克制自己"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"8436ef29-0dd3-47b5-b6ac-403044219736","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5dc6314e-9337-43d0-b231-f8942cca24b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题导向"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"091dbe6a-7512-438d-92c1-a9543fd94488","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以解决具体的问题为导向去搜集信息，而不是去各种平台接受信息流，太被动且效率太低了，我们需要化被动为主动"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6dd0439b-6c85-4fa2-91bf-0e908a52960a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"61b47e79-c9d3-4825-abaa-b01801aa2f3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持质疑"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9ba0d3a1-dc02-4d6f-bc22-e1713c107765","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于观点，我们一定要多问几句为什么，论据是什么？是有没有数据支撑？适用范围是什么？背景是什么？前提是什么？"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"收集篇，如何做筛选，获取高质量信息","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:297","type":"doc","id":297}},{"label":"原则","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:299","type":"doc","id":299}}],"prevPage":{"title":"审视自己和信息的关系","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:298","type":"doc","id":298}},"nextPage":{"title":"建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:300","type":"doc","id":300}},"createTime":1743909941340,"updateTime":1792337071162,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1792337071162}}